          "text": "raw_eq | Partial | With `-Z uninit-checks`, checks initialization of modeled operand byte extents using their shadow state, including padding bytes. All compared bytes must be initialized. Support depends on the modeled layout and origin; see [Uninitialized memory](../rust-feature-support.md#uninitialized-memory). |",
